<div class="wrap post" style="max-width:800px;padding-top:32px">
  <h1>Unsubscribe</h1>
  <p>
    To stop receiving Nestyroo emails, email
    <a href="mailto:privacy@nestyroo.com?subject=Unsubscribe">privacy@nestyroo.com</a> from the address
    you signed up with and ask to be unsubscribed. We'll process your request promptly and within the
    time required by law.
  </p>
  <p>
    Once we start sending newsletters, every email will also include an unsubscribe link.
  </p>
  <p>
    After you unsubscribe, we delete your sign-up details and keep only your email address and the date
    you unsubscribed, so we never email you again. See our <a href="/legal/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>
</div>
